  "notes": "The federal heritage designation records three storeys, a flat roof, twin capped circular east towers, two four-tier south entrance towers, large arched and squared sash assemblies, rustication, crenellations and a prominent cornice. The municipal inventory records stucco over brick, a stone foundation and alterations to the original arches."
